.MARINE...
(Today through Monday)
Issued at 1004 AM PDT Wed Oct 7 2026

Gentle to moderate north breezes and moderate seas prevail
through Thursday. Strong to near gale force north winds will
develop across the northern outer waters Friday, spreading across
the rest of the waters this weekend. Rough to very rough seas will
build Friday into the weekend as a result. Long period southerly
swell arrives Friday with long period westerly swell arriving
Sunday.

